summary:
  The heal lookup starts without asking whether the order lapsed.

history:
  A death first noticed after a night went to the directory lookup, found
  the station's address and played it: the road 2026.40 left open.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          if (_orderLapsed()) return;
          if (root._previewUrl !== "") return;

replace:
          if (false) return;
          if (root._previewUrl !== "") return;

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_every_automatic_road_to_sound_asks_whether_the_order_lapsed.
  Line-neutral.
